     "body": "<p><span class=\"error\">&#91;Followup from Sourceforge Tracker&#93;</span><br/>\nFollowup Submitter: sjw46<br/>\nLogged In: YES <br/>\nuser_id=1709161<br/>\nOriginator: YES</p>\n\n<p>While installing Fedora 2.2, if the user chooses PostgreSQL and the \"included\"<br/>\ndriver, it fails to be extracted from the installer and put in the appropriate<br/>\ninstall location as part of the end of the install process.  This causes the<br/>\ninitial attempt to start Fedora to fail until the driver is manually put in the<br/>\ncorrect place.</p>",
